{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-94","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与比例与线段","englishTitle":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a fourth apotome, the side of the area is minor.","book":10,"number":94,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":94,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","contentId":"euclid-10-94","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e998ccce1ec2cfc2aca21698c1daf46529d41ab4fdfd4e8d90e7858836be08b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-94.statement","euclid-10-94.construction.1","euclid-10-94.construction.2","euclid-10-94.proof.1","euclid-10-94.construction.3","euclid-10-94.construction.4","euclid-10-94.proof.2","euclid-10-94.proof.3","euclid-10-94.proof.4","euclid-10-94.proof.5","euclid-10-94.proof.6","euclid-10-94.construction.5","euclid-10-94.proof.7","euclid-10-94.proof.8","euclid-10-94.proof.9","euclid-10-94.proof.10","euclid-10-94.proof.11","euclid-10-94.proof.12","euclid-10-94.proof.13","euclid-10-94.proof.14","euclid-10-94.proof.15","euclid-10-94.proof.16","euclid-10-94.proof.17","euclid-10-94.conclusion","euclid-10-94.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-94.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a0dabd2e979219d68caa62f1033d63a27fea86299e80a17e357464d5bf44505","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an area be contained by a rational straight line and a fourth apotome, the side of the area is minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个区域由有理线段和第四个截差无理线段组成,则该区域的另一边为小部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b979814b88a61e2ce19e9e26d3a6dbf525f80264f2147833c94f15146655bdd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the area AB be contained by the rational straight line AC and the fourth apotome AD; I say that the side of the area AB is minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AB区分为有理线段 AC和4 截差无理线段 AD;我说,AB区一侧是小的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ee529ba543802be93240ed46c592b82ff9016e099506cc68aa11c1acbaa83de","citations":["euclid-10-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DG be the annex to AD; therefore AG, GD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, AG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line AC set out, and the square on the whole AG is greater than the square on the annex DG by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with AG, [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG是AD的附件;因此,AG,GD是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,AG是长度可公度,有理线段 AC是有理线段 AC,整个AG比附件DG的正方形长正方形,不可公度长,AG,正方形长,不可公度长,AG, [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5057373ee857fecc8033c5d852f0e39726ce2dcc4c16e58064a3386649f74073","citations":["euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on AG is greater than the square on GD by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with AG, therefore, if there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on DG and deficient by a square figure, it will divide it into incommensurable parts. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果对AG a 平行四边形的DG和DG的4部分适用等于正方形的DG, 并有正方形的缺陷,则分为不可公度部分。（相关点与线段：GD） [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f440ab69e1001dab77696339a9dc41c66cf787ffb778b43b949eb1ba2c107fcc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then DG be bisected at E, let there be applied to AG a parallelogram equal to the square on EG and deficient by a square figure, and let it be the rectangle AF, FG; therefore AF is incommensurable in length with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG两部分为E,EG对AGa 平行四边形对EG对EG,有正方形对正方形,有缺陷,矩形、AF、FG对AF对不可公度对FG对DG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b6c092709c0d6c80df3769d553ce299d1a176c62f79b72d0fc498639a03f4d8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EH, FI, GK be drawn through E, F, G parallel to AC, BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EH,FI,GK 由E,F,G 与AC,BD平行的EH,GK 绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1abfc1410456021e791589c75ba1a4fe429ad8ae0825038c40efa888fe85440","citations":["euclid-10-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then AG is rational and commensurable in length with AC, therefore the whole AK is rational. [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,AG为有理,长度可公度为AC,因此,整个AK为有理。 [[X. 19](/principles/euclid-10-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a8d7bd4d77aa14bd90e8020b53728712a43c48141e6446e849a9be59400a60a","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DG is incommensurable in length with AC, and both are rational, therefore DK is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DG,长度不可公度,AC,两者均为有理,因此DK是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3449b43c011aa21c970d348dbdd9b1c8a6320901ad830f10382d39bff924fc3b","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AF is incommensurable in length with FG, therefore AI is also incommensurable with FK. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF长为不可公度,FG长,因此AI长为不可公度,FK长 [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d62ddea8d82b549f2e400c09be8921f2a16376178a7ceb4e4d58f25dfaa72f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square LM be constructed equal to AI, and let there be subtracted NO equal to FK and about the same angle, the angle LPM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,正方形 LM的构造等于AI, NO等于FK, 大约是同一角度,即LPM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef822c5d01a27f6f35e50694f581626adc73de09588709590935f7a321308b57","citations":["euclid-6-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the squares LM, NO are about the same diameter. [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形 LM,NO 大约是相同的直径。 [[VI. 26](/principles/euclid-6-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":11,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72802f1b081a1ac963339b24e8028c256c6eb4278fd7cbc008025d669220eb2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let PR be their diameter, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让PR是直径, 让图绘制。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8af112501ad775127fdb7ef10da1e7998bcfd6d9f67005ae3f1f55acb1ccb0f","citations":["euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the rectangle AF, FG is equal to the square on EG, therefore, proportionally, as AF is to EG, so is EG to FG. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,矩形 AF FG等于EG的正方形,因此,AF-EG的比例相当于EG-FG的比例；AF 与 EG 之比等于 EG 与 FG 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9af5330f31d649eb55ea5c4615131369aecc1ff0bac9257db969e70940834efc","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as AF is to EG, so is AI to EK, and, as EG is to FG, so is EK to FK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore EK is a mean proportional between AI, FK. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AF对EG的比等于AI对EK的比,EG对FG的比等于EK对FK的比,因此,EK对AI对FK的比是比例中项对AI对FK；AF 与 EG 之比等于 AI 与 EK 之比；EG 与 FG 之比等于 EK 与 FK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2c0e0f9f7c229e1c10dae199e84df5b348ce94ce1dbab6cce5f32d5559e3eee2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MN is also a mean proportional between the squares LM, NO, and AI is equal to LM, and FK to NO; therefore EK is also equal to MN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MN也是正方形,LM,NO,AI等于LM,FK等于NO,EK等于MN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51c8f667c2b64d45832ebf5f8d22a9103f2f638f97642763c22fbed5090794c7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DH is equal to EK, and LO is equal to MN; therefore the whole DK is equal to the gnomon UVW and NO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DH等于EK,LO等于MN;因此,整个DK等于曲尺形 UVW和NO。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a056a8cdbb67d6f8b1e341e2696b981cfbc20a39e41321546f5b068e379ef88","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, the whole AK is equal to the squares LM, NO, and, in these, DK is equal to the gnomon UVW and the square NO, therefore the remainder AB is equal to ST, that is, to the square on LN; therefore LN is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AK土地相当于正方形 LM NO土地,其中DK相当于曲尺形 UVW土地,正方形 NO土地,因此,其余AB土地相当于ST土地,即LN土地,LN土地是AB土地的一侧。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44e2091fe38659208fd1d4d2a6bf210cb4888e2e7f3baa94d263091c8a9f62b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that LN is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说LN是无理线段被称作未成年人"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb4fbf58b19dc2e9f551230a628263e09485869bfb72830c79ce35410707417c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AK is rational and is equal to the squares on LP, PN, therefore the sum of the squares on LP, PN is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AK是有理,相当于LP,PN的正方形,因此,LP,PN的正方形,有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d64659afdac82ff30625365f7eb9f7b13c7dc277caf453684ce77224acb9ce0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since DK is medial, and DK is equal to twice the rectangle LP, PN, therefore twice the rectangle LP, PN is medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于DK是中项无理线段,DK等于矩形,LP,PN的两倍,因此,矩形,LP,PN是中项无理线段的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b5bfdf04fbdce799030a14b85f73ca2c8fdfcb281019534365cbb8c3ed70fe0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AI was proved incommensurable with FK, therefore the square on LP is also incommensurable with the square on PN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AIFK,LP正方形,PN正方形不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"674629e1da48076b9834b3d2f04d51db3635870e5f5e92e1eacb849ea7b3db0d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LP, PN are straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them rational, but twice the rectangle contained by them medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形的不可公度直线是LP,PN,有理直线是正方形直线的正方形,但中项无理线段直线是中项无理线段直线的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7cf3664b0f637535621606ef6441877dc061823a9b04665a9497ad28dc06db92","citations":["euclid-10-76"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore LN is the irrational straight line called minor; [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)] and it is the side of the area AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,LN是无理线段,被称为未成年人;它是AB区域一侧。 [[X. 76](/principles/euclid-10-76)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":23,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84d5afbfc456e4c969c6a5351d4971f98f08092a12039ecbd393f51976c6e46c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side of the area AB is minor. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB区一侧是小区。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-94.source","contentId":"euclid-10-94","revisionId":"euclid-10-94@raw-4e998ccce1ec2cfc","order":24,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"856b2fba39ce2382899403b76b1af39353ab10b103c488f741e3d1fa314ccdf1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-94:euclid-10-def-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-94","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-94.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-94:euclid-10-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-94","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-94.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.94","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit: